      <Form990ScheduleAPartVIGrp>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART IV, SECTION D, LINE 2</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE LILLIAN HAGOPIAN COREY CHARITABLE TRUST (THE "TRUST") WAS ESTABLISHED TO PROVIDE FOR THE "DESIGN, CONSTRUCTION, FURNISHING, EQUIPPING AND MAINTENANCE OF AN ADDITIONAL FACILITY FOR THE CALIFORNIA HOME FOR THE AGED, INC (THE "HOME"). A TRUST ADVISORY COMMITTEE WAS ESTABLISHED CONSISTING OF TWO MEMBERS FROM THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE HOME, AND THE TWO CO-TRUSTEES OF THE TRUST. THE COMMITTEE'S ROLE IS TO "DISCUSS THE STATUS AND ADMINISTRATION OF THE TRUST, THE STATUS OF THE TRUST ACCOUNT HELD BY THE HOME, AND THE STATUS OF THE HOME'S PLANS TO CONSTRUCT THE ADDITION CONTEMPLATED IN THE TRUST". THE TRUST ADVISORY COMMITTEE HAS MET FROM TIME TO TIME TO CONSIDER AND ADDRESS PROJECTS INVOLVING THE SUPPORTED ORGANIZATION.</ExplanationTxt>
      </Form990ScheduleAPartVIGrp>
      <Form990ScheduleAPartVIGrp>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART IV, SECTION D, LINE 3</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>SEE ANSWER TO SECTION D, LINE 2 ABOVE THE TRUST IS OPEN TO ANY REQUESTS BY THE HOME.</ExplanationTxt>
      </Form990ScheduleAPartVIGrp>
      <Form990ScheduleAPartVIGrp>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART IV, SECTION E, LINE 2A</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>SEE ANSWER TO SECTION D, QUESTION 2. IN ADDITION, SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ACTIVITIES OF THE TRUST FURTHERED THE EXEMPT PURPOSES OF THE HOME BY PROVIDING CONSTRUCTION EXPERTISE AND FUNDING FOR AGREED TO CONSTRUCTION RELATED PROJECTS. THE HOME IS THE ONLY ORGANIZATION SUPPORTED BY THE TRUST. THE TRUSTEES HAVE DIRECT COMMUNICATION WITH THE MEMBERS OF THE BOARD AND THE CEO OF THE HOME.</ExplanationTxt>
      </Form990ScheduleAPartVIGrp>
